            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.4.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mub 4:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.5.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "5:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi nkareeba ahansi y'eizooba, omu mwanya gw'okucweramu emanja z'oburyo, harimu obubi; kandi omu mwanya ogwabaire gurimu okuhikiirira, harimu obubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.3.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mub 3:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.16.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 16:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.2.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 2:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.5.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kor 5:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nikwo kugira omu mutima gwangye nti: Ruhanga aryacwera abahikiriire n'ababi orubanja; ahabw'okuba buri kintu na buri murimo akabiteeraho obunaku bwabyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi naagira omu mutima gwangye nti: Ruhanga naagyeza abaana b'abantu, ngu babone kumanyiraho ku batari kindi kureka enyamaishwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.49.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 49:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahabw'okuba ekihika aha bantu, nikyo kihika aha nyamaishwa; nk'oku omuntu afa, nikwo n'enyamaishwa efa. Byona bigira emiikize emwe; omuntu taine ki akiza enyamaishwa, ahabw'okuba byona ni busha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.3.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kut 3:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Byona biza omu mwanya gumwe; byona bikaruga omu mucuucu, kandi byona nimwo birigaruka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.12.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mub 12:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " N'oha orikumanya yaaba omwitsyo gw'omuntu gwinamuka ahaiguru, ogw'enyamaishwa gukashuuma omu itaka? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.2.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mub 2:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.10.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "10:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nikyo ndikureebera ngu tihariho kirikukirira omuntu okushemerererwa emirimo ye, ahabw'okuba ogwo nigwo mugabo gwe. N'oha owaakumugarura kureeba ebiribaho yaarugireho?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
